  "label": {
    "en": [
      "Fr. Jim O’Donnell, Class of 2012"
    ]
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Fr. Jim O’Donnell was ordained a priest in 1956 in the Diocese of Cleveland. His spiritual journey has led him through parish work at St. Colman’s Church in Cleveland and St. Mary’s Church in Avon. He served as the director of CYO for several years. For six weeks in 1974 he worked in India with Mother Teresa. Today and for the past 32 years, Fr. Jim lives and works in the inner-city Central neighborhood in Cleveland, OH."
    ]
  },
